### Generate download data for specific list
GET https://localhost:8443/eudr/download?listId=1
Content-Type: application/zip
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### Get analysis data
GET https://localhost:8443/eudr/analysis
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

### Get analysis data by listId
GET https://localhost:8443/eudr/analysis?listId=5442
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}


### send an invitation to create a connection between two organizations
POST https://localhost:8443/eudr/analysis
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
  "listId": 5448,
  "analysisId": "FCD",
  "status": 2,
  "errorInfo": "",
  "updateTime": "2021-06-01T10:00:00.000Z"
}

### send an invitation to create a connection between two organizations
PUT https://localhost:8443/eudr/analysis
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: gfwpro.globalforestwatch.org={{gfwpro_token}}

{
  "listId": 5442,
  "analysisId": "FCD",
  "status": 3,
  "errorInfo": "",
  "updateTime": "2021-06-01T10:00:00.000Z"
}
